s protect the skin from the negative effects of ultraviolet rays when spending time outdoors. Its<strong> creamy texture </strong>distributes evenly over the body, absorbs quickly, and leaves no stickiness or greasy residue.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"900\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://betrendy.space/content/uploads/images/40de0a7a-4e55-4767-9901-92f564f3470d.png\" width=\"600\"/></p>\n<p><strong>The formula is enriched with active ingredients</strong> that provide extra comfort and hydration.<br/>\n<strong>Macadamia oil </strong>is known for its nourishing and softening properties, helping to make the skin smooth, elastic, and hydrated.<br/>\n<strong>Coconut oil </strong>nourishes and softens the skin, maintaining its comfort and silkiness.<br/>\n<strong>D-panthenol </strong>promotes skin softening and supports its natural balance.<br/>\n<strong>Aloe vera extract</strong> helps to moisturize and maintain a fresh, well-groomed appearance of the skin.<br/>\n<strong>Food-grade glitters </strong>create a radiant glow effect that beautifully enhances your tan and adds definition.</p>\n<p>The lotion is perfect for the summer season, vacations, parties, or everyday use whenever you want to add definition, a beautiful shine, and a well-groomed look to your skin.</p>\n<p><strong>Product Benefits:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>radiant shimmering effect</li>\n<li>skin hydration and softening</li>\n<li>SPF 25</li>\n<li>lightweight texture without stickiness</li>\n<li>comfortable daily use</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Shimmer Body Lotion Highlighter Shining Star SPF 25 — a simple way to add radiance, a well-groomed look, and confidence to your skin every day.</strong></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"j-product-block__tab\" data-content-id=\"reviews-3\" style=\"display: none;\">\n<div class=\"product__section\">\n<section class=\"product-reviews\">\n<div class=\"reviews\" id=\"comments-container-uidb95b4b8e794abc51100bd42c6af5a0f8\">\n<div class=\"reviews__inner\">\n<div class=\"p-review\" id=\"uidb95b4b8e794abc51100bd42c6af5a0f8\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"reviews__add-comment\">\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n</div> </div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"product__bottom\">\n<div class=\"product__bottom-item\">\n<div class=\"j-product-block\">\n<div class=\"product-heading\">\n<div class=\"product-heading__title j-product-block-title\"><div class=\"j-product-block-title\">\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div data-view-block=\"associatedProducts\">\n<div class=\"product__section\">\n<div id=\"25150fcec1faace12f882622c8554abb\" style=\"position: relative; height: 20px\">\n<div class=\"loader\" style=\"width: 10px; height: 10px; margin: 10px 0 50px -5px; left: 50%\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"product__bottom-item\">\n<div class=\"j-product-block\">\n<div class=\"product-heading\">\n<div class=\"product-heading__title j-product-block-title\"><div class=\"j-product-block-title\">\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div data-view-block=\"associatedProducts_1\">\n<div class=\"product__section\">\n<div id=\"c4728b94a65b6e203bfe0233da962ee6\" style=\"position: relative; height: 20px\">\n<div class=\"loader\" style=\"width: 10px; height: 10px; margin: 10px 0 50px -5px; left: 50%\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"product__bottom-item\">\n<div class=\"j-product-block\">\n<div class=\"product-heading\">\n<div class=\"product-heading__title j-product-block-title\"><div class=\"j-product-block-title\">\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div data-view-block=\"associatedProducts_2\">\n<div class=\"product__section\">\n<div id=\"3261ece5072d073fde6404f0378b5da4\" style=\"position: relative; height: 20px\">\n<div class=\"loader\" style=\"width: 10px; height: 10px; margin: 10px 0 50px -5px; left: 50%\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n</div>\n<div class=\"product__bottom-wide\">\n<div class=\"product__bottom-item\">\n<div class=\"j-product-bloc